# The native app is not part of the website's deployment.
#
# The leading slash is load-bearing. Without it, a pattern matches a
# directory of that name at ANY depth -- which is how an earlier version
# of this file, listing `supabase/`, silently deleted
# `src/services/supabase/` from the deployment and broke the build with 48
# unresolved imports. `tests/vercelignore.test.ts` now fails if any
# pattern here can shadow something under `src/`.
#
# Nothing else is excluded. Docs, migrations and tests are small, the
# build ignores them anyway, and every extra pattern is another chance to
# shadow a path that matters.
/mobile/
